   "rawMarkdown": "Rule 6.c requires external models to be OSI-licensed without commercial restrictions. The RadImageNet ResNet-50 weights used in several public notebooks are listed as CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 on the Kaggle dataset marwanmath/resnet-50-radimagenet-marwan, but the same file on Hugging Face (Lab-Rasool/RadImageNet) is listed as MIT. Can hosts confirm whether submissions using these weights are eligible for prizes?",
   "content": "<p>Rule 6.c requires external models to be OSI-licensed without commercial restrictions. The RadImageNet ResNet-50 weights used in several public notebooks are listed as CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 on the Kaggle dataset marwanmath/resnet-50-radimagenet-marwan, but the same file on Hugging Face (Lab-Rasool/RadImageNet) is listed as MIT. Can hosts confirm whether submissions using these weights are eligible for prizes?</p>",
